  "description": "1 Upscale Simple No Model is a local upscaling workflow designed to increase image or video resolution with a locally loaded model using the models configured in the graph. Its 4-node graph exposes 0 prompt/text field(s), 1 media input target(s), and 1 save/preview stage(s), while preserving the original editor-format graph for reference. The ComfyUI editor graph was converted to API format and is ready for live validation against the connected node and model registry.",
